{"Title":"An Act further clarifying the delivery of health care","BillNumber":"H1123","DocketNumber":"HD1682","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AJP1","Name":"Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:30:09.257"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AJP1","Name":"Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:30:09.2566667"},{"Id":"MOM0","Name":"Michael O. Moore","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MOM0","ResponseDate":"2023-03-15T16:00:08.78"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H1123/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Puppolo of Springfield, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 1123) of Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr., relative to further clarifying the delivery of health care and dentistry.  Financial Services.","DocumentText":"\tSection 1. Notwithstanding the provisions of 101 CMR 314 or any general or special law to the contrary, Chapter 260 of the Acts of 2020 is hereby amended throughout by inserting after the words “health care provider” in each place where it appears, and by inserting in place thereof the following: --\r\n\t; provided, however, that the provisions of this section shall not apply to any provider licensed to practice dentistry. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J11","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J11"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}